 engineering functions to ensure our delivered features are consistently of a high quality. Set the test strategy, engage critically with all functions from the outset of each feature. Ensure we have design and behavioral consistency between features, and strong, efficient test coverage at every level. Determine which test scenarios should be included in our suite of end-to-end automated tests, and implement those using Cypress. Willingness to proactively help junior Quality Engineers, provide timely feedback, and guide them to success. Contribute to Mentorship Programs and onboarding new joiners. WHAT WE NEED YOU TO BRING TO THE TABLE: Ability to communicate effectively and clearly in English, and precisely describe complex interactions Ability to architect a strong Test Strategy Strong track record in advocating for quality at all levels of development process 3 - 6+ years of experience delivering quality web applications with test automation, including REST APIs/GraphQL ABOUT TECHNOLOGY: Kubernetes running on Google Cloud PostgreSQL Golang for our API, core logic, and internal tooling TypeScript, React, Redux, and CSS modules for our web application Cypress for automated end-to-end testing WHAT'S IN IT FOR YOU: A Research and Development Department of 100+ of engineers, product managers and product designers in Berlin Leaders with 8+ years of experience building our promotions engine €1,000 annual learning budget and free German language courses to boost your skills 30 days of annual leave, plus extra paid days for your birthday and moving day Home office setup budget, a monthly home office allowance Freedom to work from abroad for up to 90 days worldwide! Mental health support with nilo.health and a discounted Urban Sports Club membership 20% company subsidy on your pension contributions BVG public transport ticket and welcome your furry friend in our dog-friendly Berlin office! Lease your ideal bike through BusinessBike Show more Show less Karrierestufe Managem